The evaluation of decision models is currently triggered via REST APIs, thanks to the codegenerated endpoints.

The purpose of this task is to allow the same evaluation to be triggered via events, so that the decision engine could be included in a event processing pipeline (e.g. knative eventing).

The flow should be:
# the app listens for input events (containing the input variables) from a predefined input channel;
# when a new event comes, the corresponding model is evaluated;
# the result is wrapped in an output event and sent to a predefined output channel.

